Author: Scott Richardson - SecurIT360.com
Description: A Quick Assist event was logged
EventId: 0
Channel: Application
Provider: Quick Assist
Maps:
  -
    Property: PayloadData1
    PropertyValue: "Data: %Data%"
    Values:
      -
        Name: Data
        Value: "/Event/EventData/Data"

# Documentation:
# These event logs leave much to be desired and do not nest the data, but include some useful data. I find this article helpful when these:
# https://inversion6.com/insights/blog/microsoft-quick-assist-an-it-security-primer#:~:text=DISSECTING%20A%20QUICK%20ASSIST%20SESSION%C2%A0
